# Copy to `.env` and fill in. `.env` is gitignored — the key never belongs in a
# commit, and never in anything the browser downloads.
#
# Get one at https://build.nvidia.com/nvidia/nemotron-3.5-lightning-30b-a3b →
# "Get API Key". It starts with `nvapi-`.
#
# In production this is set in the Vercel dashboard instead:
#   Project → Settings → Environment Variables → NVIDIA_API_KEY
#
# This file is committed — put the REAL key in `.env`, never here.
NVIDIA_API_KEY=nvapi-abc'ali git add .
git commit -m "Add the impact of the API Nvidea of the project aslo the AI call agent of the prject of the thiland of the aslo the erro and u"
